WEBVTT

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:03.610
Sorry.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.150
I don't want you to get any closer to me right now.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:18.730
See you.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.330
Kokoro-chan...

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.090
Welcome back!

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.100
I'm home.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:00.260
What's wrong, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:02.850
Onee-sama...

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:04.520
Did something happen?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.930
Kippei-onii-chan doesn't look happy.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.740
He looks sad.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.980
Kippei, you bastard!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.850
Why did you make Yuzuyu-chan cry!?

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.400
What? Me?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.840
That's right! It's your fault!

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:34.060
Because you look pained, she has become sad!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.700
If someone you like is depressed, you've gotta stay composed, right?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:44.800
I see.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:45.860
Sorry.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:49.470
Then, what should I do?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:50.460
Smile!

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:54.670
If you won't smile, neither will Yuzuyu-chan!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.400
Sorry, Yuzuyu.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.760
Something sad happened to me, and well...

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.960
Sorry. I can't smile after all.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.500
Why, you...

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.070
Here!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:21.120
It's a letter!

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.390
I-I'm so happy!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.400
My! You're so talented, Yuzuyu-chan!

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:58.080
Is this Kippei?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.440
No, that's a bear...

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:06.820
I... I'll get better, and then draw Kippei-onii-chan!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.080
You're good now.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.000
This looks like Kippei!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.180
Hey...

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.630
I'm really happy though!

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.590
Because of this letter.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.340
Of course. Because she put her heart into the letter.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.640
That's what she sent... is what I'm saying.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.050
Kokoro's not coming...

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.890
It's the first time she's been absent without notice.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.970
Maybe she was poisoned by your lunch!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.700
No way.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.710
I guess the phone call yesterday is the cause.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.110
I wonder what it is! It's bothering me!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.170
I wonder if Kokoro's okay.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:55.960
When will roses bloom?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.130
After winter, when it gets warm again.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.820
Shall we make this bush our treasure?

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:04.610
Sure!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.180
Let's raise it very, very carefully.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:18.980
Okay!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:35.920
It's because having roses around can hurt children...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.070
Mom...

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.960
Look! That girl!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.560
She's from the Tokunaga household!

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.100
How sad... I wonder if she eats dinner all be herself...

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.570
It was so sudden... how her mother died...

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.140
How nice. Are you out shopping?

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:22.110
I guess it can't be helped... She has no mother...

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.020
At that time, I was unable to accept my mother's death...

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.300
Mom?

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:49.740
Every morning, I would look for her...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.240
During Parents' Day, I would look towards the back over and over.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.490
Even though I understood somewhere in my mind that my mother was gone...

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:12.450
...the fact that my mother was really gone gradually affected my life.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:18.990
One day, all of her pictures suddenly disappeared from inside the house.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.980
Dad... where are the pictures of Mom?

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:31.540
I put them away.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.310
Because you're always crying...

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:39.910
I wasn't crying... because I felt I shouldn't let him see me cry.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:43.980
It was harsh...

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.830
All reminders of my mother where disappearing from the house...

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.770
And then that person came...

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.190
Kokoro... I'm thinking of getting remarried.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.260
The only mother I have is my own!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:17.860
Even so...

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:36.040
Mom! Please say something!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.890
I can't remember your voice!

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.650
Hey... isn't Kippei-san late?

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:18.450
He'll come soon!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:23.250
I wonder... I wonder if he's on a date or something.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.470
Hey! You shouldn't look so glum!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:31.360
Your happiness will disappear!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.680
Look at this!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:40.910
Mirror, Mirror, O Mirror Divine... Grant me happiness!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:42.920
What's that?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.050
It's the charm of the mirror.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.690
Your wish will come true!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:55.850
Mirror, Mirror, O Mirror Divine... Grant Yuzuyu happiness, just like me!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:02.000
Yuzuyu-chan! Your onii-chan is here to get you!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:03.510
Okay!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.640
Marika-chan! Thank you!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.700
It's fine. Just hurry up and go!

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:14.550
Okay!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.630
Kippei-onii-chan, aren't you gonna sleep?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.100
No...

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.700
Did something sad happen again?

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.290
I'm all right, though.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.290
Because I got that letter from you...

00:12:58.310 --> 00:12:58.890
Yuzuyu?

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.490
Wait a second!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.600
Here! I borrowed it!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.240
What?

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:23.770
Mirror, Mirror, O Mirror Divine... Make Kippei-onii-chan feel better!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.690
What's that?

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.530
A charm!

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:30.820
Marika-chan taught it to me!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:31.840
I see.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:13.180
I hope your happiness doubles and your sadness is halved!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.130
From Kippei.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.040
Kokoro-chin!

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.010
Did you read my letter?

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:53.610
Yes...

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.340
Though I'm fine...

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:59.530
I'm already really happy that you've let me into your room!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.310
Honestly... that tension is annoying...

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.130
...but it relieves me.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.100
Kokoro-chin!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.360
If we can't get any closer, we can still be like this from now on, right?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:13.930
You're getting closer.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.660
Oh... Then, even without holding hands...

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.670
But I... want to be with you.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:26.000
That is, of course... if it doesn't bother you...

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.540
Summer passed quickly.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:34.650
Yeah.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.670
At this rate, autumn will be over in no time, too...

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:38.980
As well as winter...

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.550
It'd be nice if we could become adults right now...

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:42.960
Kokoro-chin...

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:53.060
I've... always hated you.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.500
It always seemed like you'd accept anything and everything...

00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.800
I was afraid of that...

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:01.540
Why?

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:07.280
Up until now, and forevermore, I'd convinced myself that I wasn't lonely, but...

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.650
When I'm with you, I feel like I'll remember that I really am lonely...

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:17.120
And I start thinking that I'll be fine with that...

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:28.990
Are you lonely now... even though I'm here?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.570
Don't make me say!

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:38.530
What?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.950
Kokoro-chin, it's not your fault...

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.430
I'll forgive you... even if you say you're not lonely, though you really are.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.640
I'm not really...

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:01.330
What?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.270
You're crying, Kokoro-chan.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.080
No way.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.000
You're crying.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.040
See?

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.070
No. Why?

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.310
You don't need to keep holding it back.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.800
You can cry.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:37.690
Mirror, Mirror, O Mirror Divine... Grant Kokoro-chan a happy smile!

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.030
What's that?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.250
It's a charm.

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:42.800
Yuzuyu taught it to me.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:44.880
She said the wish will come true.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.260
If you're sad, I'll come flying to you.

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.350
Be in love with me... without thinking about it...

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:09.170
Yuzuyu-chan's... a good girl, huh?

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:10.490
Yes.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.160
So go back to her!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.130
But... she's already sleeping.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:22.670
When she wakes up, she'll look for you for sure.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:30.550
It's because you take such good care of her that I've come to love you.

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:35.690
Kokoro-chan!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.760
Kokoro! We were worried about you!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.860
Sorry, really.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.810
You've lost weight! Are you eating properly?

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:15.770
It's okay.

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:16.890
I'm eating.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.180
Hey. Let me into your circle, too!

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.110
You're noisy!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.200
Stay away from out female circle.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:23.700
Yeah! Go away!

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.680
Kokoro-chin! They're being mean!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:27.290
Here.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:38.010
I-Is this... a l-love letter!?

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.580
No. You're wrong.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.200
But... I'm really happy!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.850
If so, then go away!

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.090
We have things to talk about!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.000
To: Kippei

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:06.180
Thank You.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.220
I was scared... that I'd always blame others...

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.920
I hated myself for that.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.320
Thank you very, very much.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.960
I couldn't say this very well, so I wrote a letter.

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:19.270
Kokoro.

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:19.680
It's yummy!

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.650
Yuzuyu-chan... what happened to my mirror?

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:24.080
Oh, that...

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:26.190
Kippei-onii-chan...

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:27.170
Ah...

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:28.760
What was that "ah"?

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:31.530
Well, how do I put this... It's... Umm...

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.020
What? Spit it out!

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:35.690
I gave it away.

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:37.730
You gave it away!?

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:38.650
To who!?

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:40.060
To my girlfriend.

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:41.830
Why, you...!

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:44.800
That was a super lucky feminine product!

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:48.030
An antique, and yet, you...

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:49.490
I'm sorry!

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:50.280
I'll page her!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:51.210
I'll do it for sure!

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:52.740
Damn straight!

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:54.960
I'd make you pay me back with your body your whole life!

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:57.480
I already think you're always using me...

00:23:59.570 --> 00:24:02.560
Ah, jeez! Why are the men here so weak when it comes to women!?

00:24:19.380 --> 00:24:21.390
I saw a dream of my mama!

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:22.960
What kind?

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:23.850
About food!

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:26.190
Food, huh?

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:27.120
Huh?

00:24:27.420 --> 00:24:29.510
Aren't those pajamas too small already?

00:24:29.660 --> 00:24:30.550
I'm fine.

00:24:30.750 --> 00:24:31.990
You have others, right? Change into them!

00:24:33.130 --> 00:24:35.400
It's fine! I'll wear these!

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:36.480
You can't!

00:24:36.480 --> 00:24:37.290
No!

00:24:37.910 --> 00:24:39.010
We tore them!

00:24:39.980 --> 00:24:41.800
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:42.110 --> 00:24:43.280
Mama's Pajamas.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.590
Where are you, Mama?
